Z||000010||87GT||11-01-1999||11:49 AM||||You know, I got to thinking about the situation in this story and I kept thinking that I had seen that in a movie somewhere.  I finally figured out where I saw it.  Does anybody rememeber Peewee's Big Adventure?  Anyways, in that movie a charachter named "Large Marge" picked up Peewee on the side of the road and Peewee later found out that Large Marge was killed in a wreck like 10 years before on the same stretch of highway. This is kind of funny me talking about Peewee Herman.. sigh..||||reg||1
Z||000011||GT Bastard||11-01-1999||12:05 PM||||Yeah, I think the story is good, but it's also a chiche... I've read quite a few scary stories in my time, and I've seen almost the exact same plot before.  You know the type.. Someone gets help from someone else, and later they find out that the person was killed long ago.  Not sure if I buy it as a true story.  Still fun to read though.||||reg||1
